orage). It never leaves your device. Data includes: fart records, water counter, food diary, mood, settings.</div></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5"><div class="mb-2 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/15 text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-globe h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg></span><h2 class="text-sm font-bold">3. Geolocation</h2></div><div class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Geolocation is optional and used only for getting local weather and determining timezone. Coordinates are not stored and not shared with third parties. If you disable geolocation — the app works fine.</div></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5"><div class="mb-2 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/15 text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wifi h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20h.01"></path><path d="M2 8.82a15 15 0 0 1 20 0"></path><path d="M5 12.859a10 10 0 0 1 14 0"></path><path d="M8.5 16.429a5 5 0 0 1 7 0"></path></svg></span><h2 class="text-sm font-bold">4. External APIs</h2></div><div class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The app uses free Open-Meteo API for weather (no key, no tracking). For IP geolocation it uses geolocation-db.com and ipwho.is (IP is not stored).</div></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5"><div class="mb-2 flex items-center gap-2"><span cla